# Scene2-4-6

; ========================================
; ●シーン2‐4‐6
; ========================================

@ModifyBackgroundExtended Scale:{g_backgroundDefaultScale} Duration:0 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:18_1
@ModifyBackgroundExtended TintColor:#000000 Duration:1.2 Lazy:false AppearanceAndTransition:Transparent SubId:Overlay
@Wait WaitMode:1.8

; ========================================
; ＞『塀の前』を選択
; ========================================

@PlayBgm BgmPath:Bgm_5_1 Volume:1 Loop:true FadeInDuration:0
@AutoSave
[PrintTextModified Text:我和蕾雅来到了一处<br>离监牢不远的围墙前。|#0204Adv06_Narrative001| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这是因为我们走到监牢外，在附近四处走动时，<br>偶然发现了亚里沙的身影。|#0204Adv06_Narrative002| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我们一路跟着亚里沙，<br>才来到了围墙前。|#0204Adv06_Narrative003| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Smile1

[PrintTextModified Text:嗨，亚里沙。你在这里做什么呢？|#0204Adv06_Leia001| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:是你们啊……<br>关你们什么事？|#0204Adv06_Alisa001| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:确实无关。<br>我们有我们的事要做，现在只是在找典狱长而已。|#0204Adv06_Hiro001| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙有看到典狱长吗？|#0204Adv06_Leia002| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:典狱长啊……今天没见到。<br>不过再往远处走一点，<br>能看到很多长得很像它的鸟在飞来飞去。|#0204Adv06_Alisa002| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:那些家伙好像是负责监视，<br>但完全听不懂人话。|#0204Adv06_Alisa003| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这样啊。你是怎么发现的？|#0204Adv06_Hiro002| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:……我烦躁得要死，<br>就朝它们丢火焰，把它们打下来了。|#0204Adv06_Alisa004| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（又是这么激进的做法……<br>　看来亚里沙也已经被逼到绝境，<br>　身心俱疲了……）|#0204Adv06_Hiro003|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:啊啊，可恶，要是能爬上这堵墙就好了。|#0204Adv06_Alisa005| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙仰望着围墙，<br>无意识地念叨着。|#0204Adv06_Narrative004| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:原来如此。你是在寻找逃出去的方法？|#0204Adv06_Hiro004| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:废话。<br>我可是从第一天开始就在想办法。<br>不赶紧离开这破地方，迟早要疯掉。|#0204Adv06_Alisa006| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:这堵墙，我已经试着爬过无数次了。<br>但无论用什么方法，都会在半途被某种力量摔下来。|#0204Adv06_Alisa007| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我轻轻触碰围墙。|#0204Adv06_Narrative005| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（难道被施加了某种魔法？）|#0204Adv06_Hiro005| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:要是再出不去……我可能，<br>就来不及了……|#0204Adv06_Alisa008| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:来不及了，是指？|#0204Adv06_Hiro006| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:……魔女化。|#0204Adv06_Alisa009| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Surprised1

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙低声吐出的单词，<br>超出我的预料，让我不禁震惊得绷紧了身体。|#0204Adv06_Narrative006| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我自己清楚。<br>我已经开始魔女化了。|#0204Adv06_Alisa010| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:魔女化程度加深后会产生杀人冲动？<br>一开始我也觉得这很荒谬。|#0204Adv06_Alisa011| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:但是，在这里每天都这么痛苦，有时和别人一不小心对上眼，<br>就忍不住想：“啊，干脆杀了她吧”……什么的。<br>也许过不了多久，我就再也不能维持自我了……|#0204Adv06_Alisa012| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Smile1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:所以啊，<br>你们最好别太靠近我。<br>我已经不知道自己会对谁产生杀意了。|#0204Adv06_Alisa013| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:20 IdAndAppearance:Hiro.Normal1,Angle01/Head01/Facial01/Mouth01>Mouth01_Pensive_Closed
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia.Pensive1
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:80 IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Normal1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:亚里沙……至少我知道，<br>你并不希望发生这种事。<br>|#0204Adv06_Leia003| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆鼻で笑う

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Smile1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:哈，你们嘴里说出来的话，<br>真是句句都那么虚伪。|#0204Adv06_Alisa014| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Angry1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:莲见、二阶堂。我最讨厌你们这种人了。<br>所以如果我真的成为魔女，<br>第一个要杀的就是你们吧。|#0204Adv06_Alisa015| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Alisa.Pensive1,Option-ArmL-Off

[PrintTextModified Text:快滚！|#0204Adv06_Alisa016| AuthorId:Alisa RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideActors ActorIds:Alisa Lazy:false
@Wait WaitMode:0.8

[PrintTextModified Text:……蕾雅，我们走吧。|#0204Adv06_Hiro007| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:我用平静的声音催促蕾雅。<br>我并没有感到愤怒。|#0204Adv06_Narrative007| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:正如蕾雅所说，亚里沙不想伤害他人。<br>正因如此，才希望我们疏远她，<br>我们应该尊重她这份心意。|#0204Adv06_Narrative008| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

; ＠備考◆ぽつりと

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false ScenePosition:50 IdAndAppearance:Leia

[PrintTextModified Text:或许，亚里沙其实是个心地善良的人呢……|#0204Adv06_Leia004| AuthorId:Leia RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:现在才发现吗？|#0204Adv06_Hiro008| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@HideAllCharacters Lazy:false

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……不只是亚里沙。<br>　我们之中的每一个人，都不想杀人）|#0204Adv06_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:回想起昨天大家快乐玩耍的场面，<br>胸口更觉沉重。|#0204Adv06_Narrative009| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（无论是互相残杀，还是彼此指控其他人是魔女，<br>　都不是我们心中所愿）|#0204Adv06_Hiro010|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:然而——那个【时刻】终会到来。|#0204Adv06_Narrative010| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:直到那个【时刻】降临，<br>我们只能恐惧着，抗争着，迷茫着，<br>静肃等待生命流逝到尽头。|#0204Adv06_Narrative011| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:我握紧拳头，迈步向前。|#0204Adv06_Narrative012| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:为了藏起指甲，我唯有把拳头越攥越紧。|#0204Adv06_Narrative013| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

@UpdateWitchBook Id:Alisa Category:Profile Version:7
@UpdateWitchBook Id:Hiro Category:Profile Version:3

